@startuml Sum_Ssfm_LinResponder_IeF_SeqDiag

participant Dem as Dem
participant LNM as LNM
participant SUSD as SUSD
participant SWC as SWC
participant RTE as RTE
box SUM_SSFM
    participant Sum_Ssfm_LinResponder_Error_Manager as IEF
    participant Sum_Ssfm_Errh_EventDebouncer_Manager as Deb
end box

activate IEF
group LIN Responder IeF Sequence of each configured <Lin_Responder>
LNM -> IEF: Data event IntElectFault changed
IEF->IEF: Execute Runnable_SSFM_LNM_<Lin_Responder>_IntElectFault_Changed
IEF -> SUSD: Ask for battery voltage range
SUSD --> IEF
alt (No OBD Support and voltage in range) or (OBD Support and not under voltage)
    IEF -> LNM: Read IntElectFault of <Lin_Responder>
    LNM --> IEF
    activate Deb
    IEF->Deb: Perform debouncing, calling Sum_Ssfm_ErrhDebouncerExecution()
    Deb-->IEF:
    deactivate Deb
    IEF -> Dem: Set/Reset related Dem events based on debouncing result
end
end

group Call back of DTC Status
Dem -> IEF: Call back DTC status changed
alt DTC Value of call back function \n matches the DTC Value of each configured LIN Responder
IEF -> SWC: Write the invalidity of all signals for the matched DTC Value of LIN Responder
end
end
deactivate IEF
@enduml 